## Errors

| Status | When |
|--------|------|
| `400` | TODO: malformed body or invalid parameter |
| `404` | any other path |
| `405` | wrong method on a known path |
| `500` | backing store failed; body is `{"error":"…"}` |

Error bodies are `{"error":"<message>"}`.

